[{"answer":"Good morning, Mrs Collins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I just wondered if you could help me with this entry form for the Young Electronic Engineer competition.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Hello, John.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, you've made the jigsaw for blind children, with the bleeper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/4.mp3"},{"answer":"When they put a piece in correctly, that's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, let's have a look at the form.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/7.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never filled in one of these before, so...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, let's just do it in pencil first.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/9-2025-03-09-10-05-57.mp3"},{"answer":"So, name of designers...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, Anne helped me with some of the electronics work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Then you must put her name in as well.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Right...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Ann Ray.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry. It's ANNE","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/15.mp3"},{"answer":"and her surname is spelt REA.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Good start! Okay...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/17.mp3"},{"answer":"REA.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/18.mp3"},{"answer":"And age is easy. You're both 16.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/19.mp3"},{"answer":"What have you called the design? Keep it short.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/20.mp3"},{"answer":"What about jigsaw puzzle design for visually handicapped?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Too long.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Just say blind puzzle, that'll do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Right, now, size of equipment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got it noted down here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/26.mp3"},{"answer":"um, yes, length, sorry, width is 20 centimetres.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Length is 50 centimetres,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the depth is... well, it's very little.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/30.mp3"},{"answer":"What would you say? I think you can be approximate.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/31.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd say 2.5 centimetres.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/32.mp3"},{"answer":"And the electricity supply?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it mains operated?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/34.mp3"},{"answer":"No it isn't, it's actually battery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, write battery.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay. It's the next bit that I'm really not sure what to put.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, special features means...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/39.mp3"},{"answer":"what is really new about this, you know, suitable for the group you made it for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it's safe for children.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/41.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine. Put that in.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, and of course we think it's educational.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There you are, you've done it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Anything else?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I think the price is good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/46.mp3"},{"answer":"That's probably the most important factor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay... cheap price.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Which brings us on to the next bit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/49.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the cost?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the pieces we made out of old wood...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/51.mp3"},{"answer":"they cost, ooh, $5.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/52.mp3"},{"answer":"And the electrics?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/53.mp3"},{"answer":"They were more expensive... say, $9.50.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what do they mean by other comments?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/56.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just a chance for you to say anything about the equipment, and problems you envisage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we would really like help with making plastic instead of wooden pieces.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, put something like, need help to make plastic pieces.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/60.mp3"},{"answer":"And the other thing is, we'd like to develop a range of sizes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/61.mp3"},{"answer":"That's fine, then, just put that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/62.mp3"},{"answer":"And the last bit is,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/63.mp3"},{"answer":"when will you send the equipment?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we've got a lot of work on at the moment and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/65.mp3"},{"answer":"we want to get it as good as we can.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, say 25th of June?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Can't we make it later?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, the last date is the 1st of July.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Why not say that?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay, that's what I'll put.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/71.mp3"},{"answer":"So, that's the lot!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/72.mp3"},{"answer":"That's brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much, Mrs Collins.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll send it off straight away.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Glad to be of help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Very best of luck to you both.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-3-2023-08-16-18-11-46/79.mp3"}]
